+| claude.ai Gmail | ✔ Connected |
+| claude.ai Canva / tldv | ✔ Connected |
+
+`node --test tools/claude-ai-run.test.mjs tools/remote-trigger.test.mjs` → **16/16 pass**（2026-10-15）。
